      "message": "Hi Seongbok Kim,\n\nI took another look, and it seems the current solution applied to other services is as follows:\n\n1) Alongside the existing `private int mLastConnectionState` add the new `private int mConnectionState \u003d STATE_DISCONNECTED`\n2) In each state\u0027s `enter()` routine set the `mConnectionState` member field of the state machine to the newly entered STATE_...\n3) in `getConnectionState()` return `mConnectionState`\n4) in `isConnected()` return \u0027mConnectionState \u003d\u003d STATE_CONNECTED\u0027\n\nThis way we store and compare just the simple integers, and we simplify the `getConnectionState()` implementation to the minimum.\nWould you mind following this practice with your patch. Let me know what do you think. Thank you.",
